# Agent runtime noise. The heavy directories are ignored individually so that
# sanitized project config stays trackable. kilo.json itself holds a literal
# bearer token and MUST stay untracked; copy kilo.json.example and fill it in.
.kilo/kilo.json
.kilo/node_modules/
.kilo/worktrees/
.claude/.mcp.json
.codex/.mcp.json

